    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Potion, Uncommon</em></p><p>After you drink this potion, you don’t need to sleep, and magic can’t put you to sleep. This effect lasts 24 hours. For the duration, you can finish a Long Rest in 4 hours if you spend those hours in a state of quiet focus, during which you retain consciousness.</p><p>This pale red potion is as thick as molasses, yet it slides out of the bottle as readily as oil.</p>",
